# EventVerse

Backend is now FastAPI (MongoDB Atlas).

Setup
1. Fill in .env (at repo root) with your MongoDB Atlas URI.
2. Install dependencies:
   pip install -r backend/requirements.txt
3. Run the API on port 3000:
   uvicorn backend.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 3000 --reload

Notes
- The frontend continues to call http://localhost:3000.
- Event images are stored as MongoDB Binary and returned as base64 data URLs.
